  "examples": [
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁⲓⲟⲩⲱ ⲅⲁⲣ ⲉⲓϣⲱⲡ ⲛⲧⲁⲕⲁⲓⲥⲉ ⲙⲛⲧⲁⲧⲏⲃⲉ · ϫⲉⲕⲁⲥ ⲛⲛⲉⲩⲕⲟⲥⲧ ϩⲛⲟⲩ**ⲕⲁⲓⲥⲉ** ⲛϣⲙⲙⲟ ·",
      "english": "For I have already bought the funerary swathings for my body and my coffin in order that they may not bury me in the funerary equipment of a stranger.",
